  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With just a snap of his finger a dynamic warrior can freeze the heart of enemies with his raw, untapped, funky love energy. As a standard action that costs 1 momentum, this crazy ray is shot from the finger of the dynamic warrior after he strikes a stylish pose. This is a ray attack with a 30 foot range that deals 1d6 + the dynamic warrior’s Charisma modifier love damage at 1st level. It deals an additional 1d6 damage at 3rd level and every odd level thereafter. The Will save for this love damage is DC 10 + 1/2 dynamic warrior level + Charisma modifier. This spontaneous love beam is generated by the power of the dynamic warrior’s soulflame.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dynamic-warrior#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
